  "description": "Cleanroom wall kit on the 3.6 m planning grid: four variants side by side 4 m apart along X (wallPanelSolid, wallPanelGlazed with a separate glazing node, wallPanelDoor with two sliding leaves and DoorOpen/DoorClose clips of 2 s, cornerPost). Each panel is 3.6 x 0.1 x 6.0 m on Y = 0; 352 triangles; four palette materials.",
  "brief": "Brief briefs/cleanroom-wall-kit.md (Foundry Floor, P0, building). One asset, four variants at X -6, -2, +2, +6 (root origin at floor level, panel-length centre, centreplane). Panel 3.6 m long, 0.1 m thick, 6.0 m tall; glazed window 3.0 x 2.0 m, sill 1.0 m, glass as separate child glazing; door opening 1.8 x 2.2 m closed by two 0.9 m leaves (doorLeafLeft -X, doorLeafRight +X, DoorOpen and DoorClose 2 s, eased, one-shot); corner post 0.1 x 0.1 x 6.0 m. Materials tool-panel-grey, aluminium-extrusion, glass-clear, rubber-black only. Budget 336 to 2400 triangles, solid and glazed at most 400 each.",
